sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    %% Figure 13: Guest Appointment Booking Sequence Diagram
    %% Verified against src/app/book/page.tsx and migrations P0/P3

    actor G as Guest
    participant BP as Booking Page /book
    participant SC as Supabase Client browser
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Supabase
    participant GS as get_booked_slots RPC
    participant CB as create_booking RPC

    G->>BP: Opens /book page
    G->>BP: Selects treatment e.g. Aura Quartz Facial 90 min
    G->>BP: Selects appointment date

    BP->>SC: rpc get_booked_slots p_date
    SC->>GS: RPC get_booked_slots date
    GS->>DB: SELECT scheduled_at duration FROM appointments WHERE status <> cancelled AND scheduled_at on date
    DB-->>GS: Returns booked time windows
    GS-->>SC: Returns booked slots array
    SC-->>BP: Returns availability data
    BP->>BP: Marks reserved time slots struck-through disabled

    G->>BP: Enters name email phone optional
    G->>BP: Submits booking form

    BP->>BP: Client-side validation required fields slot not busy
    alt Validation fails
        BP-->>G: Shows field error That time is already reserved
    else Validation passes
        BP->>SC: rpc create_booking first_name last_name email phone treatment_type scheduled_at duration notes
        SC->>CB: RPC create_booking

        alt Email matches existing patient
            CB->>DB: SELECT patient by email lower email match
            DB-->>CB: Returns existing patient_id
        else No matching patient
            CB->>DB: INSERT INTO patients first_name last_name email phone
            DB-->>CB: Returns new patient_id
        end

        CB->>DB: INSERT INTO appointments patient_id treatment_type scheduled_at duration status scheduled notes user_id
        alt Slot overlap exclusion constraint
            DB-->>CB: Raises exclusion_violation
            CB-->>SC: Converts to slot_taken exception
            SC-->>BP: Error slot taken
            BP-->>G: That time was just taken Please choose another slot
        else Booking succeeds
            DB-->>CB: Returns appointment_id
            CB-->>SC: Returns JSON appointment_id patient_id
            SC-->>BP: Returns success
            BP->>BP: Shows confirmation screen treatment time date name
            BP-->>G: Reservation confirmed
        end
    end
